e flagged two uncovered failure paths (a future CI edit reintroducing a floating '1.26'; the README tarball drifting behind go.mod) - filed as TOOLCHAIN-1.","commit_hash":"17258b9ea837358fd9ba10fd80a3dee00fdc0d3d","guard_result":"PASS","ci_result":"GREEN","worker_summary":"Go floor 1.26.9 -> 1.26.11 in go.mod (closes GO-2026-6809 + GO-2026-6859); all four ci.yml setup-go inputs pinned to exact 1.26.11; README prerequisite + bootstrap tarball moved to 1.26.11; GOTOOLCHAIN=go1.26.11 release prefix documented in README, Makefile and CHANGELOG. go.sum unchanged, no source/dependency edit."}
